---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+13025550147';
const phoneDisplay = '(302) 555-0147';
---
<Layout title="AC Not Cooling | AC Repair Middletown DE" description="AC not cooling in Middletown, DE? Same-day diagnosis and repair for warm air, weak airflow, and system failures.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>AC Not Cooling</h1>
      <p>Urgent · Middletown, DE</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>Warm air from the vents is one of the most common emergency calls in Middletown. Causes range from a failed capacitor or contactor to low refrigerant, a dirty evaporator coil, or a compressor issue.</p>
      <p>Complete loss of cooling often means a failed start capacitor, low refrigerant charge, or a tripped breaker. Same-day diagnostics restore comfort fast.</p>
      <h2>Get Help Today</h2>
      <p>Call <a href={`tel:${phone}`} style="color:var(--primary);font-weight:600">{phoneDisplay}</a> for same-day service in Middletown and New Castle County. Upfront pricing, licensed technicians, written estimate before work begins.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem">
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
